1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,672
Speaking, task three. Story number 7: At the doctor's. What happened to Olga yesterday? Tell the story from the pictures in the past tense.

2
00:00:11,367 --> 00:00:12,959
What happened to Olga yesterday?

3
00:00:33,667 --> 00:00:35,756
Yesterday morning Olga didn't feel well.

4
00:00:35,967 --> 00:00:39,290
She was lying in bed with a headache and a fever.

5
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:40,995
She couldn't go to work.

6
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:44,223
She called the surgery and made an appointment with the doctor.

7
00:00:44,433 --> 00:00:46,933
The nurse told her to come at ten o'clock.

8
00:00:47,133 --> 00:00:48,753
The doctor examined Olga.

9
00:00:48,967 --> 00:00:52,033
She told her she had flu and wrote her a prescription.

10
00:00:52,233 --> 00:00:54,125
Then Olga went to the pharmacy.

11
00:00:54,333 --> 00:00:56,061
She bought medicine and tea.

12
00:00:56,267 --> 00:00:58,624
At home she lay down and rested all day.

13
00:00:58,833 --> 00:01:08,133
Tell story 7 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
